1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,735
Slayer: something from the other side of a rift, with a vendetta against you.

2
00:00:03,955 --> 00:00:05,235
Here's how it plays.

3
00:00:06,067 --> 00:00:09,902
Put the Dimension Tracker card near the board, with your token and the Special

4
00:00:09,902 --> 00:00:11,869
Victim tokens in the Our Dimension half.

5
00:00:12,089 --> 00:00:16,207
Add a grey Mirror Dimension Victim on your space, and another on the exit space

6
00:00:16,207 --> 00:00:17,145
closest to Slayer.

7
00:00:17,365 --> 00:00:20,224
Add the Open a Rift Action cards to the Action Tableau.

8
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:25,321
The board shows both dimensions at once. Yellow Victims are in Our Dimension;

9
00:00:25,321 --> 00:00:27,604
grey Victims are in the Mirror Dimension.

10
00:00:27,824 --> 00:00:31,380
Where you and the Special Victims are is shown on the Dimension Tracker:

11
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:34,096
top half for Our Dimension, bottom half for the Mirror.

12
00:00:34,316 --> 00:00:38,007
Slayer only moves in the Mirror Dimension unless a card says otherwise.

13
00:00:38,833 --> 00:00:42,844
Movement works as normal, but only Victims in your current dimension follow you.

14
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:47,395
A Victim can only be saved when both of you are at an exit space in Our Dimension.

15
00:00:47,615 --> 00:00:52,341
Search spaces can be used in either dimension, and tokens and location effects apply

16
00:00:52,341 --> 00:00:54,873
to both dimensions unless they say otherwise.

17
00:00:54,873 --> 00:00:59,544
If one targets a Victim in a space with both kinds, Our Dimension's Victims are hit

18
00:00:59,544 --> 00:00:59,881
first.

19
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:04,545
When you see this pull symbol, Slayer drags the Victim in Our Dimension closest to

20
00:01:04,545 --> 00:01:05,436
it into the Mirror.

21
00:01:05,656 --> 00:01:08,626
For a normal Victim, swap the yellow meeple for a grey one.

22
00:01:08,626 --> 00:01:12,200
For a Special Victim, move its token to the Mirror half of the tracker.

23
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,357
Then panic that Victim.

24
00:01:13,577 --> 00:01:17,546
There are only six grey meeples. If they're all in use, the Mirror Victim farthest

25
00:01:17,546 --> 00:01:19,337
from Slayer is killed to free one up.

26
00:01:19,557 --> 00:01:22,224
And if no Victim could be pulled, raise Horror instead.

27
00:01:23,033 --> 00:01:27,474
To cross into the Mirror Dimension, buy and play Open a Rift, which costs two Time.

28
00:01:27,474 --> 00:01:31,648
Every result takes you across, and Special Victims in your space may come too.

29
00:01:31,648 --> 00:01:34,323
Two successes is free; one success costs one Time;

30
00:01:34,323 --> 00:01:36,517
no successes costs a health and two Time.

31
00:01:36,517 --> 00:01:39,567
The card also shows an alternative bottom row, marked OR.

32
00:01:39,787 --> 00:01:41,941
Normal yellow Victims can't cross with you.

33
00:01:42,161 --> 00:01:46,507
Coming back is free: any time in your Action phase, except mid-card, move your token

34
00:01:46,507 --> 00:01:49,974
back to Our Dimension. Any Victims in your space can come with you:

35
00:01:49,974 --> 00:01:53,233
swap grey meeples for yellow, and move Special Victims' tokens.

36
00:01:54,067 --> 00:01:57,889
If you're in the Mirror Dimension during the Upkeep phase, you lose one health.

37
00:01:57,889 --> 00:02:01,469
Keep your trips short: go in, gather grey Victims, and come straight back.

38
00:02:02,300 --> 00:02:06,597
To attack Slayer with actions or Items, you must be in the Mirror Dimension with it.

39
00:02:06,597 --> 00:02:10,690
The exception: if you're attacked in Our Dimension and play a Reaction card that

40
00:02:10,690 --> 00:02:12,583
deals damage, it hurts Slayer anyway.

41
00:02:12,803 --> 00:02:16,226
Slayer senses you anywhere, but only senses Victims in the Mirror.

42
00:02:16,226 --> 00:02:19,287
Targeting you or a Victim, it goes for whichever is closer:

43
00:02:19,287 --> 00:02:23,540
a Mirror Victim, or you. If it's attacking a space with only you and Our Dimension

44
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:25,667
Victims, it attacks you and ignores them.

45
00:02:25,887 --> 00:02:28,288
Targeting a Victim: the closest Mirror Victim.

46
00:02:28,288 --> 00:02:32,516
If there are none, it resolves the pull symbol instead and skips the rest of that

47
00:02:32,516 --> 00:02:33,247
Killer Action.

48
00:02:33,467 --> 00:02:36,645
Targeting the Final Girl: you, whichever dimension you're in.

49
00:02:37,467 --> 00:02:41,246
In the Panic phase, Victims in Our Dimension never panic, unless the

50
00:02:41,246 --> 00:02:43,970
Interdimensional Rift Collapse Finale is in play.

51
00:02:43,970 --> 00:02:47,749
Only Mirror Victims in Slayer's space panic, under the normal rules.

52
00:02:48,567 --> 00:02:53,021
Mind Control: in each Upkeep, every Victim in the Mirror Dimension moves one space

53
00:02:53,021 --> 00:02:53,836
towards Slayer.

54
00:02:54,056 --> 00:02:58,570
Renewed Determination moves Slayer one space towards you or the nearest Victim after

55
00:02:58,570 --> 00:03:02,440
its pull, and Master Plan punishes having lots of Victims in the Mirror.

56
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:07,060
The Epic Dark Power, It's in My Head!: at the start of each Action phase, discard a

57
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:11,513
random Action card from your hand, or lose one Time to choose which card to discard.

58
00:03:12,333 --> 00:03:15,297
Interdimensional Rift Collapse brings Slayer into our world.

59
00:03:15,297 --> 00:03:18,706
Every Victim in the Mirror dies, and you take damage if you're there.

60
00:03:18,706 --> 00:03:21,571
It now attacks twice, but you can hit it without crossing.

61
00:03:21,791 --> 00:03:26,206
Welcome to My World pulls every Victim into the Mirror, killing any beyond the six

62
00:03:26,206 --> 00:03:28,468
grey meeples, and Horror rises every turn.

63
00:03:28,688 --> 00:03:32,059
Let's Finish This pulls a Victim, then targets and attacks twice.

64
00:03:32,867 --> 00:03:35,248
A few tips. Retaliate is your best weapon:

65
00:03:35,248 --> 00:03:37,347
it damages Slayer from Our Dimension.

66
00:03:37,567 --> 00:03:40,553
Bring grey Victims back home, where Slayer can't sense them.

67
00:03:40,773 --> 00:03:42,971
And keep Mirror trips short to save health.

68
00:03:42,971 --> 00:03:43,483
Good luck.

